<pvxbig>
[build prof=Assassin/Dervish DaggerMastery=12+1+1 CriticalStrikes=7+1 ScytheMastery=9 WindPrayers=6][Reaper's Sweep][Rending Aura][Heart of Fury][Falling Lotus Strike][Twisting Fangs][Falling Spider][Blades of Steel][Resurrection Signet][/build]
